flowchart TD
  OWNER["Research question: can actual birth-derived charts predict unseen people's responses?"]
  SOURCES["Source corpora: HD, Western, Jyotish, Chinese, Tibetan, Maya + gaps"]
  WITNESS["Edition / page / original claim / cultural scope"]
  KIND{"What kind of claim?"}
  ASTR["Astronomy / calendar / chart mechanics"]
  NATAL["Natal trait or timed personal-event claim"]
  OTHER["Horary, communal, electional or ritual claim"]
  FEATURE["Deterministic feature; explicit time / calendar / source policy"]
  PRED["One falsifiable sign->observable claim; effect/negation and dependencies"]
  TIME{"Verified chart and source policy for target date?"}
  ABSTAIN["Abstain and retain variants / unknowns"]
  QUESTION["Map source-specific claim to already existing behavior question; check coverage"]
  SHARED["One common Life Patterns/HD survey bank and anonymous response per construct"]
  OVERLAP["Record source and response dependencies; 16 families are not independent confirmations"]
  FREEZE["Freeze source, engine, rules, shared questions, family tests, charts, decoys and seeds"]
  REAL["Untouched consenting humans: answers collected AFTER freeze"]
  SCORE["Forward and reverse blind scoring vs matched decoys, random charts and nonastro baseline"]
  RESULT["Report calibrated evidence, nulls, ties and failures separately by tradition"]
  NEXT["New source/model version only for future untouched cohort"]
  CORPUS["Versioned source/claim inventories"]
  OWNER --> SOURCES --> WITNESS --> KIND
  KIND -- "Astronomy/calendric only" --> ASTR
  KIND -- "Individual natal or personal timing" --> NATAL
  KIND -- "Other application" --> OTHER
  ASTR --> FEATURE
  NATAL --> PRED
  OTHER --> CORPUS
  FEATURE --> TIME
  PRED --> TIME
  TIME -- "No or variant conflict" --> ABSTAIN
  TIME -- "Yes" --> QUESTION --> SHARED --> OVERLAP --> FREEZE --> REAL --> SCORE --> RESULT
  ABSTAIN --> CORPUS
  WITNESS --> CORPUS
  RESULT --> CORPUS
  RESULT --> NEXT --> SOURCES
